  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Protects watcher-driven mutations and improves watcher robustness.\n\n      - Introduce a _watcherWriteLock and wrap modifications to path/key maps (InsertFileInternal, RemoveFileInternal, RemovePathInternal) to ensure thread-safety when FileSystemWatcher events modify HashSet/Utf8Map structures.\n      - Replace Clear() with new instances for _entriesByPath/_pathsByKey during cache clear to avoid shared-state issues.\n      - Make file reads resilient: retry File.ReadAllBytes up to 5 times (short sleep on IOException) and fail gracefully if unreadable.\n      - Add FileSystemWatcher.Error handler that attempts to reset EnableRaisingEvents and increase InternalBufferSize to reduce missed events; keep watcher start/stop streamlined.\n      - Minor cleanup: simplify StopWatcher, remove verbose XML comments and add defensive try/catch around handler/map updates to prevent exceptions from bubbling up.\n\n      These changes aim to reduce race conditions and improve stability when monitoring and updating the file cache in response to filesystem events.",
